{
  "summary": "This experiment tested RNA-only multiprofile models using scvi_n200 encoder with transformer aggregation, comparing against the avgpool aggregation baseline (config_003). Validation accuracy of 0.653 (F1: 0.628) shows a marginal improvement over the avgpool baseline (0.650), suggesting transformer aggregation may offer slight benefits. Uncertainty remains about the statistical significance of this improvement and whether other factors, such as encoder-specific characteristics, could influence the result, as no alternative fusion strategies or encoder combinations have been evaluated."
}

